:"外務省の公式アカウントです。外交に関する新着情報を中心に発信しております。｜英語版（English）@MofaJapan_en\n｜外務省ソーシャルメディア一覧： https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sn…","expanded_url":"https://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sns/list_jp.html","indices":[81,104],"url":"https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","expanded_url":"http://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/42AYao2vk0"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Square","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":584626,"following":205},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"303730149","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":20047,"tweets":48664},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/42AYao2vk0"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2089976834389913667"],"editable_until_msecs":"1787127881000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_annotations":{"is_image_editable_by_grok":false},"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":1317,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2089976834389913667","created_at":"Wed Aug 19 07:24:41 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,66],"entities":{"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/sxj5MOaMng","expanded_url":"https://x.com/MofaJapan_jp/status/2089976834389913667/photo/1","ext_alt_text":"外務報道官談話：国際刑事裁判所（ＩＣＣ）に対する米国の制裁\n１　今般、国際刑事裁判所（ＩＣＣ）の裁判所長である赤根智子判事が、米国の制裁措置の対象として新たに追加されました。\n２　我が国は、国際社会における最も重大な犯罪の処罰と撲滅、法の支配の徹底のため、常設の国際刑事法廷であるＩＣＣを一貫して支持してきています。このような立場から、今回の措置は大変残念です。\n３　我が国としては、引き続き、関係国等と意思疎通を取りつつ、国際社会における法の支配の強化に取り組んでいく考えです。","ext_media_availabilit